h。回答：是同样的麦哦，虽然但是，效果不如录音也是正常的。录音能调整的太多啦。不过直播的效果真的很差吗[emot=acfun,1692/]","time":1598492618185,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"300561865","root":"300125315","user":{"id":"58566","name":"keyblade","avatar":"ae486500316f4439467ada09"},"text":"不差不差，就只是说偶尔也会炸之类的嘛……上面确实很多歌惹，反正就全当参考啦之后看心情可以慢慢来嘛，不急不急，注意休息，保肝要紧( ﾟ∀。)","time":1598494512971,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"1001Project","replyToUserId":"179922","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"300562385","root":"300125315","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"好滴[emot=acfun,1797/]","time":1598494550227,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"keyblade","replyToUserId":"58566","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"301947990","root":"301947990","user":{"id":"1265039","name":"豆豆の抱枕","avatar":"56225feb979d752764892ae6"},"text":"龙王[emot=acfun,1880/]可以点冷门车万歌吗？","time":1598578058667,"floor":69,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"301976135","root":"301947990","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"可以动态下面留言唷hhh","time":1598579528651,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"300828898","root":"300828898","user":{"id":"348529","name":"菲特·高町","avatar":"ff46ddbc0f9f6fb6ce7fec6e"},"text":"水姐，魔炮的innocent starter可以吗[emot=acfun,1805/]","time":1598510780809,"floor":68,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"300695049","root":"300695049","user":{"id":"164656","name":"迷离的大葱","avatar":"acbeeffafcea70c3a4eb63e1"},"text":"[img=图片]https://imgs.aixifan.com/content